{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"doug-cockle","name":"Doug Cockle","birthDate":"1970-09-16","birthPlace":"Twentynine Palms, California, USA","bio":"Doug Cockle is an American actor and director. He is currently working as a freelance actor.\n\nCockle is known for his voice-over roles in video games, most notably of Geralt of Rivia in The Witcher series. He was nominated for a Game Award for Best Performance and won Golden Joystick Award Best Gaming Performance for his portrayal of Geralt in The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Doug Cockle, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:34:37+00:00","tmdbId":1047370,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1047370","credits":[{"id":"cap-first","title":"Captain America: The First Avenger","character":"Young Doctor","characterFa":"دکتر جوان"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/doug-cockle.webp","filmography":[{"name":"The Witcher: Sirens of the Deep","year":2025,"character":"Geralt (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/y0pR5aBVvPn5uncaZjl94ZEnuEF.jpg"},{"name":"The Amateur","year":2025,"character":"CIA Security Agent","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/SNEoUInCa5fAgwuEBMIMBGvkkh.jpg"},{"name":"Predator: Killer of Killers","year":2025,"character":"Einar (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2XDQa6EmFHSA37j1t0w88vpWqj9.jpg"},{"name":"Jay Kelly","year":2025,"character":"Nathan","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lEXYpY9X17pGC7xYYy17Guv0L3J.jpg"},{"name":"Natural Six","year":2024,"character":"Kelnys","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4iyRiRNXQszMdWYERRpP2g64JBc.jpg"},{"name":"Natural Six: Action Surge","year":2024,"character":"Self","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4iyRiRNXQszMdWYERRpP2g64JBc.jpg"},{"name":"Future TX","year":2022,"character":"Dylan's Dad","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kQ1vBPqU8PWurW8SMxQKdnQ2HZn.jpg"},{"name":"Criminal","year":2016,"character":"Extraction Team Leader","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hn6HmGTopbbxv4Myy2IwGWxViFP.jpg"},{"name":"Dark Noir","year":2014,"character":"Vincent Black (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/s0DkU8x346tH11Zl7UKF8guwmKr.jpg"},{"name":"Captain America: The First Avenger","year":2011,"character":"Young Doctor","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vSNxAJTlD0r02V9sPYpOjqDZXUK.jpg","characterFa":"دکتر جوان"},{"name":"Dot.Kill","year":2005,"character":"Financial News Anchor Man","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kpCnpec0yTLwm1ql2rOEneTtKmu.jpg"},{"name":"London Voodoo","year":2004,"character":"Lincoln Mathers","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qqOB0PStiebd1DQh3SxUztU12Bu.jpg"},{"name":"The Calcium Kid","year":2004,"character":"News Reporter (uncredited)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eug0h5nFQZTClWpmuf3E3xovsgS.jpg"},{"name":"Reign of Fire","year":2002,"character":"Goosh","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vZVXCj3jXzIPJUHLaQohzt2uTM3.jpg"},{"name":"The Tailor of Panama","year":2001,"character":"Pentagon Aide","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/na80ysnoCvoxwGTMWCWYvnmaDlz.jpg"},{"name":"Band of Brothers","year":2001,"character":"Father John Maloney","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eLdcio9HBKzsdIJGeD80oObDfkr.jpg"},{"name":"Murphy's Law","year":2001,"character":"Quirrell","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ujGg6IKiEoE5aqkddHepSWPfqXb.jpg"}],"nameFa":"داگ کاکل","bioFa":"داگ کاکل بازیگر و کارگردان آمریکایی است. او در حال حاضر به عنوان یک بازیگر آزاد مشغول به کار است.\n\nکاکل به خاطر نقش‌های صداپیشگی‌اش در بازی‌های ویدیویی، به ویژه در نقش Geralt of Rivia در سریال The Witcher شناخته می‌شود. او برای بازی در نقش گرالت در The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt نامزد جایزه بازی بهترین اجرا شد و جایزه جوی استیک طلایی بهترین بازی را دریافت کرد.\n\nشرح بالا از مقاله ویکی‌پدیا داگ کاکل، با مجوز CC-BY-SA، فهرست کامل مشارکت‌کنندگان در ویکی‌پدیا.","birthPlaceFa":"تونتینین پالمز، کالیفرنیا، ایالات متحده آمریکا","bioFaAttribution":"Description above from the Wikipedia article Doug Cockle, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","bioFaLicense":"CC-BY-SA"}}
